    <string name="ob_eyebrow">The stranger on a train</string>
    <string name="ob_title">Meet each other again, as fellow travellers</string>
    <string name="ob_text">People tell a stranger on a train what they never tell those closest to them. Night Train gives the two of you that evening: a compartment, a polite conductor with hundreds of questions, a window full of passing landscapes, and a tunnel where the most honest things get said.</string>
    <string name="ob_text2">Put the phone on the table between you. Every trip is laid out anew: the line, the stations with their rules, the passengers who sit down for a while, the restaurant car. No question comes twice until you have heard them all.</string>
    <string name="ob_names_title">Who\'s travelling?</string>
    <string name="ob_names_text">Names show whose turn it is. Leave them blank to travel as Passenger 1 and Passenger 2.</string>
    <string name="ob_seat_title">How do you sit?</string>
    <string name="ob_seat_text">You can change it any time in the settings.</string>
