    <string name="set_about">About</string>
    <string name="set_method">The questions deepen as the night goes on, after Arthur Aron\'s study of how gradual, mutual openness brings people closer. Guessing each other\'s answers is the idea of John Gottman\'s love maps: knowing the other person\'s inner world, and keeping that knowledge up to date.</string>
    <string name="set_deck">The deck holds %d cards. No question repeats until you have heard them all.</string>
    <string name="set_privacy">No account, no cloud, no ads and no internet permission. Everything stays on this phone.</string>
